cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Milaun in research or in a deployed system, please cite it as below."
title: "Milaun: offline record linkage for Nepali names across Devanagari and Latin script"
abstract: >-
  Milaun compares Nepali personal names written in Devanagari or Latin script and
  returns a calibrated probability that two records describe the same person. It
  combines a Devanagari-native phonetic key, a consonant-skeleton projection,
  blocking, and probit-calibrated triage, and runs offline with no third-party
  dependencies.
authors:
